    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "However, the conversation becomes a little bit more complex when the more difficult questions need to be asked.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "27505B0969",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "Let me tell you a story, see.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C1A9592713",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "Once upon a time, there was a woman named Miss Margaret.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "345DA1B344",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "Miss Margaret had been a front-desk specialist for almost 20 years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "765F74FA8C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "never, and I do mean never",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C03DCF12A5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "And in all that time, she has never, and I do mean never, had to ask a patient their gender, race or ethnicity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "765D1EDE10",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "Because, see, now Miss Margaret has the ability to just look at you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22A3E74584",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 7,
        "text": "Uh-huh.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4B05E52C26",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "she can tell if you are a boy or a girl, black or white, American or non-American",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2238C7B181",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "970F064F04",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "And in her mind, those were the only categories.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "88D1CF6976",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
